  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Peel and cut pumpkin into wedges.\n• Cut zucchini into bite-sized chunks.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/697ad7a09629deb2e47d8758/step-20855900.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place pumpkin on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with garlic & herb spice blend and season with salt. Toss to coat.\n• Place snacking tomatoes and zucchini on a second lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt. Toss to coat.\n• Roast veggies until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/697ad7a09629deb2e47d8758/step-d8f24c10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When veggies have 10 mins remaining, boil the kettle. Add couscous and the stock powder to a large heatproof bowl.\n• Add the boiling water and butter, then stir to combine. Immediately cover with a plate and leave for 5 mins. Fluff up with a fork and set aside.\n• When veggies are done, add roasted tomatoes and zucchini to couscous. Add baby spinach leaves and a drizzle of vinegar. Toss to combine. Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/697ad7a09629deb2e47d8758/step-bb06e620.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide roast veggie couscous between bowls.\n• Top with garlicky roast pumpkin.\n• Crumble over fetta cubes and top with a dollop of dill & parsley mayonnaise to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/697ad7a09629deb2e47d8758/step-a9e0ff30.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
